flowchart LR
  Dev[Developer]:::neutral --> GH[GitHub Repository]:::automation
  GH --> CI[GitHub Actions<br/>test · scan · validate]:::automation
  CI --> GHCR[GHCR<br/>SHA-tagged image]:::automation

  subgraph LOCAL[Environment B — Local laptop / Kind]
    direction LR
    Helm[Helm release]:::k8s --> Ingress[Optional Ingress]:::k8s
    Ingress --> Svc[Service]:::k8s
    Svc --> Pods[FastAPI Pods ×2]:::k8s
    Kind[Kind cluster]:::k8s --- Helm
  end
  GHCR -. manual pull/load .-> Pods

  subgraph VM[Optional disposable Ubuntu VM]
    Ansible[Ansible]:::linux --> Tools[Docker · kubectl · Kind · Helm]:::linux
  end

  subgraph AWS[Environment A — AWS blueprint only]
    TF[Terraform validation]:::aws --> VPC[VPC 10.30.0.0/16]:::aws
    VPC --> Public[2 public subnets + IGW]:::aws
    VPC --> Private[2 private subnets<br/>no default Internet route]:::aws
  end

  CI --> TF
  Ansible -. optional lab host .-> Kind
  Security[Non-root · least privilege · Trivy · Checkov]:::security --- CI

